          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "`groupby()` follows **split → apply → combine**: split the rows into groups by the key column(s), apply a function to each group, and combine the results into one table."
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "text": "df.groupby('dept')['salary'].mean()\ndf.groupby(['dept','level'])['salary'].sum()\ndf.groupby('dept').agg({'salary':['min','max'], 'age':'mean'})"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "headers": [
